The complete Docker lifecycle is:

```text
                    Dungeon source code
                           |
                           v
                    +---------------+
                    |    RESTORE    |
                    | NuGet packages|
                    +-------+-------+
                            |
                            v
                    +---------------+
                    |     BUILD     |
                    | Release build |
                    +-------+-------+
                            |
                  +---------+---------+
                  |                   |
                  v                   v
          +---------------+   +---------------+
